d by landfills where  acid rains threaten  any vegetation that attempts to survive  and the south is dominated by a vast  desert  though biotechnica's protein farms and  the jackson plains power plant can also  be found here  it's pretty much the wild west out in  the badlands so don't expect a safe  journey wherever you're traveling to  while there's plenty more details to be  mined from cyberpunk 2020 that should  give you a pretty good idea of the  regions you'll be questing through in  cyberpunk 2077.  as always let us know what other law  topics you'd like to see covered in our  next video  be sure to check out our previous  episodes and we'll see you again soon  you

